# Expense & Salary Manager

Next.js 15 App Router + Prisma/PostgreSQL + NextAuth v5 (Credentials, JWT) + Zod + shadcn/ui.

## Always

- Prefer Server Components; `"use client"` only for interactive UI.
- Mutations: Server Actions in `lib/**/actions.ts` with `"use server"`.
- Auth: call `requireAuth()` before user-owned DB work; filter by `userId`.
- Validate with Zod in `lib/validations/*` before writes.
- Action results: `{ success: true, data? }` | `{ success: false, error, fieldErrors? }`.
- Revalidate paths after mutations (`revalidatePath`).
- Imports use `@/` aliases; reuse `components/ui/*`.
- Never commit `.env` or secrets; document new vars in `.env.example`.
- Minimal diffs — no unrelated refactors.

## Key paths

`app/` routes · `lib/auth` · `lib/income` · `lib/dashboard` · `prisma/` · `middleware.ts`

## Product docs

`docs/PRD.md` · `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` · `docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` — update when scope, architecture, or UI conventions change.
